 Master Prompt Build WhatsInit — AI-Powered Food Intelligence & Personalized Nutrition Platform

Act as a senior full-stack developer, AI engineer, UIUX designer, and product architect. Build a complete, responsive, modern web application called WhatsInit.

WhatsInit helps people understand what is inside their packaged food, evaluate food product claims using available evidence, discover healthier and affordable alternatives, generate personalized recipes, and connect with qualified dietitians.

The application must feel like a real, usable startup product—not a static landing page or a basic AI chatbot.

